    "title": "Video captures tire flying across I-76 before slamming into SUV in Philadelphia - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By 6abc Digital Staff ,\n1 hours ago\nDashcam video captured a loose tire rolling along Interstate 76 in Philadelphia before it slammed into an SUV.\nThe incident happened around 12:30 p.m. Wednesday near Girard Avenue.\nA Tesla driver told Action News he was traveling westbound on the Schuylkill Expressway when his vehicle's cameras recorded the tire bouncing over the median and striking an SUV behind him.\nThe driver said he heard the impact but did not realize what had happened until he reviewed the footage.\nIt was not immediately clear where the tire came from or what vehicle it may have detached from.\nAction News is working to determine whether anyone was injured in the crash.",
    "summary": "By 6abc Digital Staff , Dashcam video captured a loose tire rolling along Interstate 76 in Philadelphia before it slammed into an SUV. The incident happened around 12:30 p.m. Wednesday near Girard Avenue. A Tesla driver told Action News he was traveling westbound on the Schuylkill Expressway when his vehicle's cameras recorded the tire bouncing over the median and striking an SUV behind him. The driver said he heard the impact but did not realize what had happened until he reviewed the footage. Action News is working to determine whether anyone was injured in the crash.",
